Subject: [PATCH] test(ui): replay recorded local-model chat workflows

Replay three complete q08 turns through the real AI panel and document history. Preserve raw replies and pin document values, refusals, confirmation decisions, and grouped undo. Document the source mapping and recording format.

Fixes #3411
